==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - cookies:
      - session=abc; Path=/; HttpOnly; Secure
      - prefs=dark; Path=/; Max-Age=31536000; SameSite=Lax
==== explainer ====
HTTP cookies to include when serving this hypermedia
